WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.360
You recorded the visit.

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.630
noctune wrote the note.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.470
Now it has to get into
your practice system.

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.610
Click the noctune icon in your browser.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.290
Your notes are already synced.

00:00:10.847 --> 00:00:12.047
Click a field.

00:00:12.047 --> 00:00:13.237
Press your hotkey.

00:00:13.807 --> 00:00:14.607
That's Subjective.

00:00:14.607 --> 00:00:15.327
Again.

00:00:15.327 --> 00:00:16.127
Objective.

00:00:16.127 --> 00:00:16.877
Again.

00:00:17.313 --> 00:00:19.383
Discharge instructions too.

00:00:19.393 --> 00:00:21.633
It never saves or sends anything for you.

00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:24.113
You read it, then Save in your PIMS.

00:00:24.113 --> 00:00:25.463
It just does the copying.

00:00:26.353 --> 00:00:29.233
Works with any practice
system that runs in a browser.

00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:30.503
No integration needed.

00:00:31.047 --> 00:00:32.167
noctune.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:32.957
Try it today.
